{
  "id": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
  "displayName": "Claude Sonnet 4.6",
  "provider": "anthropic",
  "family": "claude-4",
  "modelVersion": "2026-02-17",
  "status": "ga",
  "contextWindow": 1000000,
  "maxOutputTokens": 128000,
  "hostingModes": ["anthropic"],
  "defaultHostingMode": "anthropic",
  "interfacesByHostingMode": {
    "anthropic": ["messages"]
  },
  "interfaces": ["messages"],
  "defaultInterface": "messages",
  "inputModalities": ["text", "image"],
  "outputModalities": ["text"],
  "capabilities": ["reasoning", "vision", "function-calling"],
  "protocolProfiles": {
    "messages": {
      "thinking": {
        "parameter": "thinking.type",
        "types": ["adaptive", "enabled", "disabled"],
        "shimDefault": "adaptive",
        "validation": "passthrough"
      },
      "reasoning": {
        "parameter": "output_config.effort",
        "levels": ["low", "medium", "high", "max"],
        "default": "high",
        "aliases": {
          "xhigh": "max"
        },
        "validation": "passthrough"
      }
    }
  },
  "pricing": {
    "currency": "USD",
    "billingUnit": "1M tokens",
    "sourceType": "anthropic-official",
    "status": "published",
    "inputPer1mTokens": 3,
    "cachedInputPer1mTokens": 0.3,
    "cacheWrite5mPer1mTokens": 3.75,
    "cacheWrite1hPer1mTokens": 6,
    "outputPer1mTokens": 15
  },
  "proxyTemplate": {},
  "sources": {
    "reasoning": "https://github.com/anthropics/skills/blob/main/skills/claude-api/SKILL.md#thinking--effort-quick-reference",
    "capabilities": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/foundry/foundry-models/concepts/models-from-partners#anthropic",
    "limits": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/foundry-models/concepts/claude-models",
    "modalities": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/sonnet-4-6/overview",
    "lifecycle": "https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/foundry/foundry-models/concepts/claude-models#available-claude-models",
    "pricing": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Anthropic's exact-model pricing table, checked 2026-10-11, publishes cache-read and both TTL-specific cache-write rates. Regional surcharges and discounts are not included.",
    "Microsoft Foundry lists the Anthropic-infrastructure offering as GA. maxInputTokens remains independently unverified; contextWindow minus maxOutputTokens is not an input limit.",
    "protocolProfiles.messages.thinking.default remains unset because Anthropic's native omitted-field behavior is thinking off. shimDefault=adaptive is a proxy-only conversion policy that activates thinking only for cross-protocol requests asking for visible reasoning, not as an Anthropic default.",
    "The xhigh to max alias is a proxy compatibility mapping; xhigh is not an Anthropic-native effort level for Sonnet 4.6.",
    "Azure Foundry 可直接部署 Claude Sonnet 4.6，但微软文档当前说明 model-router 还不支持 claude-sonnet-4-6。"
  ]
}
